# The image build context only needs server/ + web/ + apk/. Keep everything else out so
# the (slow, multi-arch) build stays lean and a docs/compose change can't invalidate it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/data
.git
.gitignore
.github
docs
screenshots
android
**/*.md
# …except the release notes, which SHIP in the image: the admin panel's "What's new" reads
# /app/CHANGELOG.md so the notes always describe the version running. It is copied in the
# last runtime step, so editing it only invalidates that one cheap layer.
!CHANGELOG.md
